		       +====================+
		       | Tar File Interface |
		       +====================+

Author:  Charles E. Campbell  <NdrOchip@ScampbellPfamily.AbizM>
	  (remove NOSPAM from Campbell's email first)
Copyright 2005-2012:					*tar-copyright*
